{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e11-scene-05",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "布小谷转正总编室策划  (Promoted to Full Planner)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Having seen Bu Xiaogu step out of her admirer's sports car from his window, Chun Yuqiao receives her completed files, stiffly credits her admirer for landing the Golden Class, and calls HR on the spot to promote her. Listen to Bu Xiaogu and Chun Yuqiao in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，您昨天要的文件做好了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "辛苦了，工作表现不错。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "黄金一班的事有你的功劳，也有许天泽的功劳，主要是许天泽的功劳。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我是淳于乔。布小谷转正总编室策划，今天生效。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢谢淳于总！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "现在去办手续。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好，谢谢淳于总！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "把电脑留下，公司会给你换新的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不用麻烦，我觉得这电脑真挺好用的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "共享信息不方便。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我不怕您看我的上网记录，真的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我不想看你的上网记录。关门。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，您昨天要的文件做好了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Chun Yuqiao, the documents you asked for yesterday are all ready.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "辛苦了，工作表现不错。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Good work — your performance has been solid.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "黄金一班的事有你的功劳，也有许天泽的功劳，主要是许天泽的功劳。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You deserve credit for the Golden Class reunion, and so does your rich friend — mostly him.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我是淳于乔。布小谷转正总编室策划，今天生效。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is Chun Yuqiao. Make Bu Xiaogu a permanent planner in the chief editor's office, effective today.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢谢淳于总！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you, Mr Chun Yuqiao!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "现在去办手续。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Go complete the paperwork right now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好，谢谢淳于总！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Okay — thank you so much!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "把电脑留下，公司会给你换新的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Leave that laptop here; the company will issue you a new one.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不用麻烦，我觉得这电脑真挺好用的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No need to go to the trouble — I find this laptop really nice to use.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "共享信息不方便。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sharing data on my personal machine is inconvenient.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我不怕您看我的上网记录，真的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'm not afraid of you seeing my browsing history, honestly.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我不想看你的上网记录。关门。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have zero interest in your browsing history. Close the door.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，您昨天要的文件做好了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "辛苦了，工作表现不错。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "黄金一班的事有你的功劳，也有许天泽的功劳，主要是许天泽的功劳。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我是淳于乔。布小谷转正总编室策划，今天生效。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢谢淳于总！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "现在去办手续。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好，谢谢淳于总！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "把电脑留下，公司会给你换新的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不用麻烦，我觉得这电脑真挺好用的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "共享信息不方便。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我不怕您看我的上网记录，真的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我不想看你的上网记录。关门。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Ordering a bewildered Xiaogu to leave his spare laptop behind and shut the door on her way out, Chun Yuqiao hides his jealousy behind icy formality. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
